6. Helper controls (scratchpad spec importing helpers.mjs, 1 passed)
   extractResetLink accepts a good link (and decodes &amp;). It throws for a foreign origin,
   a missing token, two distinct links, a plaintext/HTML mismatch, a wrong path and an empty
   message. sign() yields sha256=<64 hex> and differs for whitespace-different bytes.

